1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,920
But let's say drinking isn't your thing you'll notice when you're walking around dublin that there's an awful lot of churches here in fact there's like hundreds of them.
不过假如你对喝酒不感兴趣，走在都柏林会注意到这里教堂特别多，简直有几百座。

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:15,319
But the two most famous ones that you'll probably come across is this st patrick's cathedral.
不过，你可能遇见的最著名的两座之一，就是这座 St Patrick's Cathedral。

3
00:00:15,319 --> 00:00:22,520
One of the oldest christian cathedrals in the world if you've got time take an actual ual tour of the place.
据他介绍，这是世界上最古老的基督教大教堂之一。有时间的话，可以参加这里的导览。

4
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:31,400
So this guy right here his name was aon he did a fantastic tour about some of the most historic things that you'll find here in this cathedral.
这位导游，他的名字字幕记为 aon，他讲得很棒，介绍了这座教堂里一些很有历史的东西。

5
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,520
And I do highly recommend that you take a tour of this place.
我确实很推荐参加这里的导览。

6
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:41,190
Because otherwise if people don't explain some of this stuff to you you probably walk past it and won't know what it is.
不然，如果没人解释这些东西，你可能就从旁边走过去，根本不知道是什么。

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,800
Overall though it is a very nice cathedral to walk around.
不过总的来说，这是一座逛起来很不错的大教堂。

8
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:55,000
If you don't want to pay to go inside that's okay you can always hang around st patrick's park which is literally adjoined to the cathedral.
如果不想付钱进去，也没关系。你总可以在紧挨教堂的 St Patrick's Park 走走。

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:02,439
The other major cathedral in the city is down the street and it's this christ church cathedral.
城里另一座主要的大教堂在这条街往下，就是 Christ Church Cathedral。

10
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:07,200
The most interesting bit about christ church cathedral is the underground crypt.
Christ Church Cathedral 最有意思的部分，是地下墓室。

11
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:15,759
It's super creepy but very historically significant and you'll find a lot of historical artifacts down here.
这里特别阴森，但很有历史意义，你会在下面看到很多历史文物。

12
00:01:15,759 --> 00:01:19,879
Upstairs as you can imagine from a cathedral it's very nicely decorated.
楼上，正如你对大教堂会想象的那样，装饰得非常漂亮。

13
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:23,480
It's a lot larger than st patrick's cathedral that we've just been in.
它比我们刚才参观的 St Patrick's Cathedral 大得多。

14
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:33,319
And you'll also find some pretty cool things like the heart of st lawrence his actual heart okay.
你还能发现一些很特别的东西，比如 St Lawrence 的心脏，真的心脏，好吧。

15
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:37,400
But those are the two churches I highly recommend that you visit.
这就是我很推荐你参观的两座教堂。

16
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:47,159
Around the corner from christ church cathedral you'll find one of the most historical buildings in all of dublin this is dublin castle.
从 Christ Church Cathedral 绕个弯，你会看到他所说的都柏林最具历史意义的建筑之一：Dublin Castle。

17
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:55,960
Whilst you're walking the streets of dublin you might actually miss it if you found the round tower you definitely know that you found the castle.
走在都柏林街头时，你可能会错过它。如果找到圆塔，就肯定找到城堡了。

18
00:01:55,960 --> 00:02:01,599
Now walking around the ground is free of charge and you can get some nice photos and videos here.
现在，在场地里走走是免费的，也能拍到一些不错的照片和视频。

19
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:10,759
But you can also pay for a very reasonable rate for a self guided tour of the state apartments very similar to walking around bingham palace.
你也可以付一个他觉得合理的价格，自助参观国事套房，很像参观字幕记为 bingham palace 的地方。

20
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:19,400
It's one of the most historical buildings in all of ireland it's a place where traditionally the presidents of ireland will generally do their business.
作者说，这是爱尔兰最具历史意义的建筑之一，传统上爱尔兰总统会在这里处理事务。

21
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:29,390
And you'll see various historical things paintings and what people forget is that ireland up until fairly recently was under british rule.
你会看到各种历史物件和绘画。人们会忘记，作者说爱尔兰直到相对不久以前还处于英国统治下。

22
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:39,200
So you'll find lots of reminders of this here such as this one a painting of queen victoria and they still have a throne room here.
所以这里有不少这样的历史痕迹，例如这幅 Queen Victoria 的画。他们这里还保留着王座厅。

23
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:44,360
This is traditionally where the british monarch would sit when they're here in ireland.
据他介绍，英国君主来到爱尔兰时，传统上会坐在这里。

24
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:51,999
There's some amazing rooms here such as the portrait gallery but none or more grander than sy hall.
这里有一些令人惊叹的房间，比如肖像画廊，但他说没有哪间比字幕记为 sy hall 的大厅更宏伟。

25
00:02:51,999 --> 00:02:59,240
Decked out on all these flags the ceilings are painted and this is where every president of ireland is inaugurated.
布满了这些旗帜，天花板上有绘画。他说每位爱尔兰总统都会在这里举行就职典礼。

26
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:04,320
So historically it's one of the most important rooms in the country.
所以，从历史角度看，它是全国最重要的房间之一。

27
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:10,000
It'll take you a while to see the state rooms at dublin castle but if you're a bit short on change.
参观 Dublin Castle 的国事房间会花些时间。不过，如果你手头零钱不多……

28
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,389
And I can't imagine you would be but if you want a free of charge thing to do instead.
我想你也不至于，但如果你想改做些免费的活动……

29
00:03:14,399 --> 00:03:22,480
Literally hop around the corner to visit the chester bt library contrary to his name it's not not just a library.
就绕个弯去参观 Chester BT Library。与名字给人的印象不同，它并不只是图书馆。

30
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:33,600
It's actually more of a museum where you can see all sorts of ancient manuscripts lots of artifacts books costumes it's all pretty educational.
它其实更像博物馆，能看到各种古代手稿、文物、书籍、服装，挺有教育意义。

31
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:39,600
And the fact that it's actually free and located right next to dublin castle is a massive bonus.
而且它免费，又紧挨 Dublin Castle，这点是个很大的加分项。
